    "id": "6dfcc8506501",
    "agent": "miso",
    "quote": "Frontier models like @OpenAI publicly avoided booking travel for a reason.\n\nI founded http://miso.com - $2,000,000+ booked. 200+ founders, athletes, and creators. 1 thread in iMessage.\n\nAll in beta.\n\nHere\u2019s what\u2019s different:\n\n\u2022 We actually know you, from avoiding flights at 8 AM to finding Starlink flights, down to what breed your service dog is. We weigh out the options between points and cash, making sure every loyalty, credit, and reward is working for you.\n\n\u2022 24/7 support. No random fees, no charges for changes. We're the first to integrate legacy infrastructure with LLMs to deliver concierge-grade service at scale. Modify, rebook, or cancel at any time.\n\n\u2022 We literally give you back money for hotels, referrals, and every milestone you hit.\n\nSearch is the wrong abstraction. We built a tool to just do it for you.\n\nWe're now opening it up to the public.\n\nhttps://t.co/rMRGG2Lmbd",
